OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cold, clear start with risk
OL,6,Fof frost. Then remaining dry and
OL,7,Fsettled through the day with plenty of
OL,8,Fsunny spells and some patchy cloud.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FDry and settled overnight
OL,11,Fwith light winds and largely clear
OL,12,Fskies. Turning cold again, with frost
OL,13,Fdeveloping in places along with a few
OL,14,Ffog patches.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSunday:FAnother cold start with frost
OL,17,Fin places and any fog patches quickly
OL,18,Fclearing. Remaining dry and settled
OL,19,Fduring the day with plenty of sunshine
OL,20,Fand light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
