OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FA
OL,6,Frather changeable few days, with a
OL,7,Fgood deal of dry weather initially,
OL,8,Fbut an increasing risk of patchy rain
OL,9,Fdeveloping as the period progresses.
